# Phase 14 Journey Completion (v1.0.0)

Phase 14 is the **final** AI Counseling Journey phase. Engine **`PHASE14_ENGINE_VERSION = v1.0.0`**.

Owns only: closure copy, `journeyCompleted`, `platformHandoffPayload`, final analytics, terminal state.

## Must never

Recommend colleges; mutate rankings; restart counseling; objection handling; schedule; remind; book; assign counselors; update CRM; invoke platform booking APIs.

## Outcomes

`booking_initiated` | `booking_deferred` | `information_only` | `opted_out` | `journey_completed`

## Analytics

`journey_completed`, `journey_outcome`, `journey_duration`, `journey_interactions`, `platform_handoff_created`, `booking_status_final`

## Surfaces

`constants/careerCounsellingV2JourneyCompletion.js`, `careerCounsellingV2JourneyCompletion*.js`, `scripts/phase14ProductionCertification.js`, `scripts/phase1to14Regression.js`

## Policy

No Phase 15+. Additive future work only with architecture review + freeze waiver on earlier baselines.
